message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "paralogSL: Paralog-Based Synthetic Lethality Prioritization via Delta Dependency"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-05-25
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.21502114
authors:
  - family-names: Mo
    given-names: Qingqing
  - family-names: Zhu
    given-names: Tao
    email: zhutao@tjh.tjmu.edu.cn
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0001-0779-2245"
repository-code: "https://github.com/tjogzt/paralogSL"
url: "https://github.com/tjogzt/paralogSL"
abstract: >-
  A lightweight R package for prioritizing paralog-based synthetic lethality (SL)
  candidates through Delta Dependency analysis. Computes DD scores from DepMap
  Chronos gene-effect data, identifies candidate paralog-SL pairs using HGNC gene
  family annotations, and provides discovery-stage evaluation metrics.
keywords:
  - synthetic lethality
  - paralog compensation
  - cancer dependency map
  - drug target discovery
  - computational biology
